Date: Mon, 7 Sep 2026 23:56:43 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 2902/3799] soh: rename func_80B3EEEC -> EnXc_NextAfterAction32

Name source: DEDUCED from the code (confidence HIGH) -- zeldaret/oot
leaves this symbol address-named too, so there is no upstream name to adopt.
Reason: the same guard from action 32 to 33
Defined in soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_En_Xc/z_en_xc.c.

Tagged [LLM:HIGH] at the definition, every declaration and every call site, so a
reader meeting the name anywhere knows it is inferred.
---
 soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_En_Xc/z_en_xc.c | 5 +++--
 1 file changed, 3 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)

diff --git a/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_En_Xc/z_en_xc.c b/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_En_Xc/z_en_xc.c
index ace2049d9..4970ff463 100644
--- a/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_En_Xc/z_en_xc.c
+++ b/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_En_Xc/z_en_xc.c
@@ -1296,7 +1296,8 @@ void EnXc_NextAfterAction31(EnXc* this) {
     EnXc_CheckAndSetAction(this, SHEIK_ACTION_31, SHEIK_ACTION_32);
 }
 
-void func_80B3EEEC(EnXc* this) {
+// LLM generated name (HIGH), was func_80B3EEEC: the same guard from action 32 to 33
+void EnXc_NextAfterAction32(EnXc* this) {
     EnXc_CheckAndSetAction(this, SHEIK_ACTION_32, SHEIK_ACTION_33);
 }
 
@@ -1368,7 +1369,7 @@ void EnXc_ActionFunc31(EnXc* this, PlayState* play) {
 
 void EnXc_ActionFunc32(EnXc* this, PlayState* play) {
     EnXc_ActionFunc7(this, play);
-    func_80B3EEEC(this);
+    EnXc_NextAfterAction32(this);  // was func_80B3EEEC [LLM:HIGH]
 }
 
 void EnXc_ActionFunc33(EnXc* this, PlayState* play) {
